      "content": "that's a great start. it really captures that 'great man' vibe. can you expand on the idea that the socioeconomic arguments are actually just excuses used by historians who want to avoid acknowledging his power? like, make it sound like those other theories are just a way to underestimate how much one person can actually change the world.",
